            <ArticleTitle>Mechanical thrombectomy using the AngioJect in a child with congenital heart disease.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>253-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Acute thrombosis of a vascular channel can be a serious and perhaps fatal complication. We describe a patient who developed complete thrombosis of the left pulmonary artery following catheter placement of a stent in this vessel shortly after open heart surgery. The thrombosis was successfully removed using the Possis AngioJet mechanical thrombectomy catheter.</AbstractText>
